##! Unicode's tables for names (RULES.md, R136), generated by
##! `tools/unicode_tables.py` from Unicode 15.1.0 as Python's `unicodedata`
##! has it: do not edit it by hand, and `check.sh` fails when it is stale.
##! Each table is a text of fixed-width records in hexadecimal, sorted by
##! their first field, each followed by one space or line break, so that a
##! lookup is a binary search over the text itself (`stage1.text.names`).

